= <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#C72F35">PCd'I</span> Consolidates support base 

Though the recent split of the <span style="color:#8B0000">Left</span> faction to form the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#C72F35">Partito Comunista d'Italia</span> as a splinter party was originally considered to be moribund, our <span style="color:#B22222">labour</span> faction breaking with us as well has resulted in the <span style="color:#2F2F2F">syndicalist</span> *Unione Sindacale Italiana* to defect to the party, as the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#C72F35">PCd'I</span> seems to have consolidated and become a competitor to our party.  
